      {
        "label": "可靠性参考线",
        "value": "Pass³ 通常比 Pass@1 低 8–20 个百分点",
        "note": "Kimi K3 (max)：76.5% vs 68.5%（低 8.0）；Muse Spark 1.2 (xhigh)：75.9% vs 63.0%（低 12.9）；Gemini 3.5 Flash (high)：67.3% vs 53.7%（低 13.6）；Inkling (xhigh)：45.5% vs 25.5%（低 20.0）。Pass³ 才是「每次都做对」的比例。",
        "cite": [
          "hf-traj@指标定义",
          "leaderboard@表头说明"
        ]
      }
